WEBVTT

00:07.750 --> 00:10.292
You got it all wrong.
I was looking for you.

00:10.375 --> 00:12.250
-Yeah. to kill us.
-No, I want to help.

00:14.208 --> 00:17.292
I don't know what you or the agency thinks
that you're doing here, but it's--

00:17.375 --> 00:20.375
Well, I don't know
what a Lieutenant Governor actually is,

00:20.458 --> 00:22.750
so I guess we're even, aren't we, Juan?

00:23.792 --> 00:25.458
All of this is not supposed to be

00:25.542 --> 00:27.750
in a warehouse in Brooklyn,
it's supposed to be on its way

00:27.833 --> 00:28.958
to Guinea-Bissau.

00:29.042 --> 00:31.417
-[groans]
-[Fisk] Your shipment will be delivered.

00:31.500 --> 00:33.708
I would ask that you practice patience!

00:34.417 --> 00:36.167
[Daniel] You really don't have to
do this, man.

00:36.250 --> 00:37.667
I don't even know what I did.
But whatever it was,

00:37.750 --> 00:39.792
-I probably deserve it.
-Get out of the car, Daniel.

00:39.875 --> 00:41.792
We work for a man
who can change your life.

00:41.875 --> 00:43.583
And all he asks in return is loyalty.

00:43.667 --> 00:44.792
Make a choice.

00:46.667 --> 00:48.750
Javi, I need you to do something for me.

00:49.208 --> 00:50.375
[Javi] Yo, you're BB.

00:50.458 --> 00:52.458
-Can I get a pic?
-Yeah, for sure. Come on.

00:56.667 --> 00:58.125
[Dex] First, you try to kill me,

00:58.208 --> 00:59.917
and then you try to save me.

01:00.792 --> 01:03.125
I'm trying to save you
because I tried to kill you.

01:03.208 --> 01:04.208
Little help?

01:06.542 --> 01:07.750
Vanessa?

01:08.333 --> 01:11.083
-Nurse!
-[EKG flatlining]

01:51.292 --> 01:53.708
[Dr. Merati]
"They that love beyond the world

01:54.542 --> 01:56.208
"cannot be separated by it.

01:58.667 --> 02:00.750
"Death cannot kill what never dies."

02:03.917 --> 02:08.000
-I'm deeply sorry for your loss, Mr. Fisk.
-[sobs]

02:09.542 --> 02:12.583
Even in her final moments,
she was the brightest of lights.

02:15.042 --> 02:16.833
Take solace in knowing that she...

02:17.417 --> 02:18.625
is at rest now.

02:21.833 --> 02:24.833
Gone to the beautiful darkness
that awaits us all.

02:31.542 --> 02:33.125
It has been a sad honor...

02:34.583 --> 02:36.833
accompanying you
on this journey, Mr. Fisk.

02:53.250 --> 02:56.250
[groaning] Mr. Fisk.

02:56.750 --> 02:58.292
[chokes] Mr. Fisk--

02:58.542 --> 02:59.958
Mr. Fisk.

03:00.042 --> 03:02.250
-[choking]
-[bones cracking]

03:49.292 --> 03:51.792
-[bell tolling]
-[♪ somber music playing]

04:26.917 --> 04:29.958
"Requiem aeternam dona ei, domine

04:30.958 --> 04:33.375
"et lux perpetua luceat ei.

04:33.833 --> 04:35.375
"Requiescat en pace."

04:35.542 --> 04:36.542
Amen.

04:36.875 --> 04:38.750
"Domine Iesu Christe,

04:40.375 --> 04:41.833
"Rex gloriae

04:42.750 --> 04:44.875
"libera animas omnium

04:44.958 --> 04:47.000
"fidelium defunctorum...

04:53.917 --> 04:56.083
"De poenis inferni..."

04:59.625 --> 05:00.625
Nothing here.

05:00.708 --> 05:02.167
[priest] "Et de profundo lacu..."

05:02.250 --> 05:03.333
[chuckles] Okay.

05:08.042 --> 05:09.583
[priest] "Libera eas

05:09.792 --> 05:11.208
"de ore leoni."

05:12.833 --> 05:15.042
Thank you, Mayor Fisk.

05:18.708 --> 05:21.667
[priest] "Ne absorbeat eas tartarus...

05:30.542 --> 05:32.417
"Ne cadant in obscurum."

05:33.750 --> 05:34.750
[priest] Amen.

06:03.042 --> 06:04.667
[whispers indistinctly]

07:05.417 --> 07:07.875
[♪ theme music playing]

08:18.292 --> 08:20.458
[female automated voice] On your mark.

08:20.542 --> 08:21.542
Get set.

08:21.917 --> 08:22.917
Spin!

08:24.542 --> 08:26.042
Oh, nice try.

08:26.125 --> 08:27.333
Spin again.

08:35.542 --> 08:36.667
Let's go for more.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.875
On your mark.

08:37.958 --> 08:39.542
Get ready. Spin!

08:40.500 --> 08:41.500
Way to go!

08:41.583 --> 08:43.250
[man] Hey, there she is! [groans]

08:45.500 --> 08:48.708
-[man grunting]
-[device beeping]

08:51.250 --> 08:53.417
[man groaning]

08:59.042 --> 09:00.958
[man screaming in pain]

09:02.958 --> 09:07.250
[beeping intensifies]

09:07.333 --> 09:08.333
[Jessica] Honey.

09:10.750 --> 09:13.375
-This is not a toy.
-[clicks, beeping stops]

09:17.083 --> 09:19.333
He's lost a lotta blood,
but I got the bullet out.

09:19.417 --> 09:21.667
If he can keep it clean
and prevent infection,

09:21.750 --> 09:23.333
which is a big "if,"

09:23.417 --> 09:24.417
he should be fine.

09:24.875 --> 09:25.875
Angela,

09:26.333 --> 09:27.708
[in Spanish] pasame esa venda por favor.

09:27.792 --> 09:29.500
[in English]
Thank you, Soledad. Good to know.

09:29.583 --> 09:32.458
[Soledad] I'm really doing my best here.
But he could really use a hospital.

09:32.542 --> 09:33.542
No.

09:33.833 --> 09:35.625
[Daredevil] That would sign
his death warrant.

09:35.708 --> 09:36.708
Maybe we should.

09:36.792 --> 09:38.875
-Karen.
-[Karen] What? I'm not behind this.

09:38.958 --> 09:41.083
He should be dead
or in one of Fisk's dungeons, not here.

09:41.167 --> 09:42.667
-Understood.
-[Angela] She's right.

09:42.750 --> 09:44.083
The whole city is popping off
'cause of what he did.

09:44.167 --> 09:45.333
[Daredevil] It was an accident.

09:45.708 --> 09:46.708
[Karen] This time.

09:48.417 --> 09:50.458
Hey. What's goin' on out there?

09:51.250 --> 09:52.917
[Angela] Lotta people
crying their eyes out,

09:53.000 --> 09:54.917
throwing thoughts and prayers
about the Mayor's wife.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.042
But not everyone.

09:56.125 --> 09:57.125
[Angela] Not even close.

09:57.208 --> 09:59.292
Even more people are pissed,
and not at him.

09:59.958 --> 10:02.458
The raids and people disappearing,
it's worse than ever.

10:02.542 --> 10:04.833
There's a lotta talk
about the vigil at City Hall.

10:05.125 --> 10:06.125
Like people,

10:06.542 --> 10:07.542
our people.

10:08.167 --> 10:09.167
Sounds like trouble.

10:09.250 --> 10:10.417
[speaking Spanish] Si Titi.

10:19.042 --> 10:20.167
[Karen, in English] Listen,

10:20.250 --> 10:22.625
I need you to promise me
that you're gonna stay low.

10:23.458 --> 10:25.208
You're gonna stay safe, okay?

10:27.000 --> 10:28.125
[Angela sighs]

10:30.417 --> 10:32.000
[footsteps retreating]

10:32.083 --> 10:34.042
[door opens]

10:34.333 --> 10:36.000
[door closes]

10:40.083 --> 10:42.042
-Any news from Christofi?
-[Karen] No.

10:42.125 --> 10:44.792
But my source should drop
the Red Hook testimony soon.

10:44.875 --> 10:47.417
Good. That'll help
with the hearts and minds.

10:47.500 --> 10:48.500
[Karen] Oh, we've got those.

10:48.583 --> 10:50.167
The Resistance grows every day.

10:50.875 --> 10:52.958
Whenever someone
gets locked up or disappears.

10:53.042 --> 10:54.750
-It's not enough, we need more.
-How do you mean?

10:54.833 --> 10:56.250
[Karen sighs]

11:00.333 --> 11:01.667
Okay. Uh...

11:02.917 --> 11:03.917
[clears throat]

11:06.458 --> 11:08.958
Do you remember that night
at the Clinton Street Church?

11:13.583 --> 11:16.417
He killed Father Lantom and then
he hurt you so bad, I actually

11:16.500 --> 11:19.167
-thought I'd lost you for a minute.
-Yeah. Yeah, I remember.

11:23.792 --> 11:26.792
So you told me that you were gonna
kill Fisk and I told you not to.

11:27.333 --> 11:29.375
-That I knew how--
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, I remember.

11:32.542 --> 11:33.667
What if I was wrong?

11:34.417 --> 11:35.542
Karen, please stop it.

11:35.625 --> 11:38.458
Can't you see that is
what separates us from him?

11:38.542 --> 11:41.542
-Are we really still that separate?
-Yes, we are! We are separate.

11:42.042 --> 11:43.583
It is not up to us to take life.

11:43.667 --> 11:45.083
I know, I know!

11:45.167 --> 11:47.792
All right, I pay every day
for what I did to Wesley.

11:47.875 --> 11:49.708
I still have fucking nightmares!

11:54.667 --> 11:56.625
But the difference is I don't regret it.

11:56.708 --> 11:57.750
It was him or me.

11:57.833 --> 12:00.375
And what if that's what it's like with you
and Fisk? Him or you?

12:00.458 --> 12:03.833
What if this doesn't end
until one of you goes down?

12:03.917 --> 12:05.750
I can't think about it that way.

12:05.833 --> 12:07.083
[Karen] Well, you're gonna have to.

12:07.167 --> 12:09.667
He has proven that he will not hesitate!

12:13.833 --> 12:15.750
This isn't-- It's not-- This isn't you.

12:15.833 --> 12:17.125
-It's not you.
-[phone buzzes]

12:28.958 --> 12:29.958
-It's her.
-Where?

12:31.125 --> 12:32.292
310, Garnet Street.

12:32.375 --> 12:33.375
Okay.

12:34.917 --> 12:36.042
What do we do about him?

12:39.708 --> 12:41.458
Vengeance isn't justice, Karen.

12:42.833 --> 12:43.833
Yeah.

12:45.375 --> 12:46.375
I won't be long.

12:46.792 --> 12:47.833
Hey...

12:57.792 --> 12:59.000
[door opens]

13:01.458 --> 13:02.583
[door closes]

13:13.958 --> 13:16.333
Mayor Fisk, I just wanted to say how--

13:16.417 --> 13:17.958
[people chattering indistinctly]

13:22.417 --> 13:25.292
[Governor] With Vanessa, at least I had
a sense someone had his ear,

13:25.375 --> 13:26.583
someone could rein him in.

13:26.667 --> 13:28.333
I wouldn't have relied on that much.

13:28.417 --> 13:29.917
Pressure on my office is immense.

13:30.000 --> 13:32.500
I'm getting it from all sides,
the raids, the Task Force.

13:32.583 --> 13:35.792
Well, I don't see him budging.

13:35.875 --> 13:37.208
Not after this.

13:37.292 --> 13:38.958
Well, he may not have a choice.

13:40.417 --> 13:41.417
What does that mean?

13:41.500 --> 13:43.708
[LT. Governor Gomez]
She said this was gonna be her last term.

13:43.792 --> 13:45.125
And then you'd get the nod?

13:45.208 --> 13:47.750
Yeah, she promised to support
my candidacy. Yes.

13:48.542 --> 13:50.417
You know, where I'm from,

13:50.958 --> 13:54.667
the lady gets to keep the crown right up
until the big man upstairs comes along.

13:54.750 --> 13:55.750
Yeah?

13:56.375 --> 13:59.000
Well, where you're from,
spotted dick is a dessert.

13:59.083 --> 14:01.625
-[chuckles softly]
-This is not a monarchy, Cashman.

14:03.208 --> 14:04.458
[Buck] Are you sure about that?

14:04.542 --> 14:06.417
You've waited patiently, haven't you?

14:06.500 --> 14:07.917
You've been a loyal servant.

14:08.000 --> 14:09.708
-Yeah, you're damn right.
-Mmm.

14:11.083 --> 14:12.750
Well, why wait for the big man then?

14:13.417 --> 14:15.750
You once told me
you'd never run for higher office.

14:15.833 --> 14:17.583
You know I can't stomach the campaign.

14:20.583 --> 14:22.458
What if I told you, you wouldn't have to?

14:23.250 --> 14:24.875
So, when were you going to tell me?

14:24.958 --> 14:26.000
Tell you what?

14:26.583 --> 14:27.625
Happy birthday.

14:28.250 --> 14:31.167
I guess I'm not really feeling
the birthday this year, you know?

14:31.667 --> 14:32.917
I need to be here for him.

14:34.833 --> 14:37.042
I don't think you really can be.

14:37.583 --> 14:40.042
Come on. All right, where are we going
tonight? What are we doing?

14:40.125 --> 14:42.750
Um, we're doing nothing. Nowhere.

14:42.833 --> 14:44.000
Why are you lying to me?

14:44.083 --> 14:45.833
Why are you keeping tabs
on my personal life?

14:45.917 --> 14:49.458
Daniel, it's your birthday.
I put it in my phone calendar, you psycho.

14:51.792 --> 14:52.875
[grunts softly]

14:54.958 --> 14:55.958
I get it.

14:56.333 --> 14:57.667
It's dudes only, right?

14:58.042 --> 14:59.833
Luger's? Flashdancers?

14:59.917 --> 15:01.417
My mother's house.

15:03.667 --> 15:04.667
Seriously?

15:05.042 --> 15:06.667
-Yeah.
-[chuckles softly]

15:07.583 --> 15:09.083
Wait, that's really sweet.

15:09.167 --> 15:10.917
[Daniel] Oh, well, I'm glad you think so.

15:11.000 --> 15:13.167
What if I came with?

15:13.250 --> 15:14.667
To my ma's house?

15:15.583 --> 15:17.875
You actually wanna come to Staten Island?

15:17.958 --> 15:19.000
Yeah.

15:19.500 --> 15:20.500
I do.

15:20.583 --> 15:22.042
-Uh...
-[Buck] Miss Urich.

15:22.875 --> 15:24.042
Lovely to see you.

15:24.125 --> 15:25.125
Everything good?

15:26.042 --> 15:28.542
You do always seem to be
where the action is, don't you?

15:28.958 --> 15:31.292
Well, that's
what journalists do, Mr. Cashman.

15:31.375 --> 15:32.875
Journalists, right.

15:33.250 --> 15:35.208
Do you mind
if I borrow Daniel for a second?

15:35.292 --> 15:36.958
Just a quick word.

15:37.833 --> 15:39.583
Sure. Of course.

15:39.667 --> 15:40.667
Thanks.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.000
Shall we?

15:48.208 --> 15:50.000
-Fuck.
-Daniel, Daniel,

15:50.083 --> 15:52.667
-you need to pull yourself together.
-What we did last night was insane.

15:52.750 --> 15:54.083
It was an order,

15:54.167 --> 15:56.708
and it is behind you,
and you move on, okay?

15:57.292 --> 15:59.667
Listen to me, our little nature walk
was the price of admission.

15:59.750 --> 16:01.167
You're in the big time now.

16:02.667 --> 16:03.958
And the big time

16:04.042 --> 16:05.292
will take care of you.

16:08.417 --> 16:10.792
-[sighs] God.
-If...

16:11.750 --> 16:13.125
you take care of it.

16:13.208 --> 16:14.208
[scoffs] What do you mean?

16:14.667 --> 16:15.667
What?

16:19.708 --> 16:20.708
Our friend, BB.

16:21.417 --> 16:22.542
What about her?

16:22.625 --> 16:24.708
Daniel, I know you're fond of her.

16:25.542 --> 16:27.792
But I think you're letting it
cloud your judgment.

16:27.875 --> 16:29.542
Well, she's not the leak.

16:29.625 --> 16:31.667
-Okay, and do you have proof?
-I don't need it.

16:31.750 --> 16:33.708
Well, I do, and more importantly,
the Mayor does.

16:36.458 --> 16:38.375
Sounds like you two
have plans for tonight.

16:38.458 --> 16:41.375
Yeah, but with everything going on,
I'm just gonna blow it off.

16:41.458 --> 16:42.458
Don't.

16:43.042 --> 16:46.042
Have you ever heard of
the Barium Meal Test?

16:46.125 --> 16:48.625
Yeah, it's like a meal plan or something.

16:48.708 --> 16:50.292
Like Paleo, my mom's on it.

16:50.375 --> 16:52.125
No, Daniel, it's... it's not a meal plan.

16:52.208 --> 16:53.458
More of a technique

16:53.875 --> 16:55.625
developed by my former colleagues.

16:56.500 --> 16:57.917
In order to find a mole,

16:58.417 --> 17:01.125
you must first offer them something
to out themselves with.

17:01.208 --> 17:02.208
Yeah?

17:02.500 --> 17:03.500
Yeah.

17:04.917 --> 17:06.458
Feed her something false.

17:07.458 --> 17:09.000
See if it resurfaces.

17:09.708 --> 17:10.958
You see, barium

17:11.292 --> 17:13.875
glows like a light in the darkness.

17:14.875 --> 17:15.875
You with me?

17:16.667 --> 17:17.750
I am.

17:18.500 --> 17:19.792
Good man.

17:20.833 --> 17:21.833
Oh.

17:23.083 --> 17:24.583
And happy birthday.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.042
[cell phone vibrates]

17:41.125 --> 17:42.125
[Mr. Charles] Hi.

17:42.625 --> 17:43.958
You stole my shit.

17:46.833 --> 17:48.083
So, what? So just...

17:48.750 --> 17:49.833
everyone loses?

17:49.917 --> 17:51.375
Is that how this goes?

18:00.625 --> 18:02.375
Fine, fuck it. Whole thing's

18:02.458 --> 18:05.250
got Kabul 2021 vibes,
and I do not need an Abbey Gate.

18:05.333 --> 18:06.750
The sad fucking thing is,

18:06.833 --> 18:08.750
I had really high hopes for you.

18:08.833 --> 18:09.958
So...

18:11.042 --> 18:14.000
-Hello? Are you there? Hello--
-[cell phone beeps off]

18:18.292 --> 18:19.667
Fuck!

18:19.750 --> 18:22.667
[people chattering indistinctly]

18:32.875 --> 18:34.083
Let's light this shit up.

18:35.667 --> 18:37.417
Vanessa Fisk was part of the problem!

18:37.500 --> 18:38.750
-Don't cry for her!
-[woman] Huh?

18:38.833 --> 18:40.750
[Javi] Cry for the people
Fisk has locked up!

18:40.833 --> 18:42.625
How many of our neighbors have disappeared

18:42.708 --> 18:44.458
at the hands of Fisk and his pigs?

18:50.750 --> 18:52.750
[footsteps approaching]

18:57.917 --> 18:59.542
-You hurt?
-I'm pissed.

19:00.292 --> 19:01.958
They showed up at my house, Matt.

19:02.625 --> 19:03.708
With my daughter there.

19:04.125 --> 19:06.792
-You said this wouldn't touch me.
-It shouldn't have, Jess.

19:07.292 --> 19:10.083
-That's way outta Task Force jurisdiction.
-Wasn't Task Force.

19:11.708 --> 19:13.542
After you called, I did some digging.

19:13.875 --> 19:16.833
Found out who's been running guns
with Fisk and giving him all this cover.

19:16.917 --> 19:19.333
I'm assuming a dozen different warlords
in half a dozen countries?

19:19.417 --> 19:22.542
Or certain segments of the US government.

19:22.625 --> 19:23.625
Oh, really? No shit.

19:25.333 --> 19:26.375
A while ago,

19:26.792 --> 19:29.208
this guy called. Obviously agency.

19:29.292 --> 19:31.458
Obviously sketchy as hell.

19:32.208 --> 19:33.208
He was...

19:33.792 --> 19:36.167
interested in people like us.

19:39.958 --> 19:41.458
I told him to fuck off.

19:43.583 --> 19:45.083
Not everyone I know did.

19:48.667 --> 19:49.750
Oh.

19:51.083 --> 19:52.125
Turns out...

19:53.333 --> 19:56.542
Charles is mighty cozy with Mayor Fisk.

19:56.625 --> 19:58.875
And either I'm rusty or he's really good,

19:58.958 --> 20:01.750
because an entire wet team
showed up at my house this morning.

20:01.833 --> 20:03.250
They're worse off than I am.

20:03.958 --> 20:05.792
Way you're breathing,
you might've cracked a rib.

20:05.875 --> 20:07.083
I'm fine. Shit happens.

20:07.167 --> 20:08.250
No.

20:08.792 --> 20:10.417
No, it doesn't, not to you.

20:15.250 --> 20:16.333
I don't know.

20:17.292 --> 20:19.417
After Danielle, it just...

20:20.500 --> 20:21.917
drops out sometimes,

20:22.417 --> 20:23.500
and then comes back.

20:25.500 --> 20:28.375
I don't think there's an owner's manual
for this shit, you know?

20:30.000 --> 20:31.042
How's she doing?

20:32.083 --> 20:33.500
She's good. She's a handful.

20:33.583 --> 20:34.583
Yeah?

20:36.417 --> 20:37.417
Look, I'm sorry.

20:37.500 --> 20:38.792
-You owe me.
-Sure.

20:39.250 --> 20:41.417
I'm guessing that's why
you wanted to meet here.

20:41.708 --> 20:43.542
He moved the guns from the port.

20:43.625 --> 20:44.708
[man] Center bay!

20:44.792 --> 20:46.333
Keep going. Keep going.

20:46.417 --> 20:47.833
[watch ticking]

20:50.792 --> 20:53.042
[man] A little more. A little more. Hold!

20:53.250 --> 20:54.292
Hold for inspection!

20:54.375 --> 20:57.792
These guns, Fisk was running them
for this guy, Charles?

20:59.000 --> 21:00.000
Yep.

21:00.625 --> 21:02.208
But then his Task Force took 'em?

21:02.583 --> 21:03.583
Yep.

21:03.667 --> 21:05.375
-Okay.
-So...

21:06.458 --> 21:08.667
do you wanna cause a little trouble?

21:09.917 --> 21:11.708
[yells, groans]

21:16.458 --> 21:17.583
It's Daredevil!

21:18.833 --> 21:19.833
[groans]

21:38.333 --> 21:39.458
You don't wanna do that.

21:42.458 --> 21:43.583
[groans]

21:49.208 --> 21:50.500
[both grunt]

21:50.875 --> 21:52.042
-[man 1] Move in!
-[man 2 grunts]

22:03.833 --> 22:05.625
-[grunts]
-Fuck!

22:05.708 --> 22:06.750
[both grunt]

22:11.458 --> 22:13.417
I'm gonna fuckin' enjoy-- [groans]

22:13.792 --> 22:14.792
Let's go.

22:19.042 --> 22:21.375
[man 1] Everybody out,
this place is gonna blow!

22:21.458 --> 22:22.875
-[man 2] We gotta go!
-[man 3] Hurry!

22:22.958 --> 22:24.083
-Get outta here!
-Go!

22:24.167 --> 22:25.833
-[man 2] Move, move!
-[man 1] We gotta move!

22:25.917 --> 22:26.958
Come on, come on!

22:27.042 --> 22:28.042
[man 2] Move!

22:28.125 --> 22:29.417
-[man 3] Watch out! Watch out!
-[exploding]

22:39.833 --> 22:41.375
[horn honks]

23:33.708 --> 23:36.125
[ominous voices whispering indistinctly]

23:41.583 --> 23:42.625
[voices stop]

23:43.167 --> 23:44.250
Heather.

23:45.708 --> 23:46.792
Buck, I, uh...

23:48.292 --> 23:49.375
I didn't...

23:51.167 --> 23:52.333
You miss her.

23:55.542 --> 23:56.542
So do I.

23:57.333 --> 23:59.458
I lost a lotta friends coming over here.

24:00.083 --> 24:02.125
-I don't have a lotta people.
-Neither do I.

24:06.083 --> 24:07.250
You carry a gun.

24:09.167 --> 24:10.917
Suit's supposed to cover it, but...

24:12.417 --> 24:14.542
-I know it's there.
-It's part of the job.

24:16.000 --> 24:17.625
I assume you've killed people.

24:19.083 --> 24:20.292
Heather, are you okay?

24:25.583 --> 24:27.333
The man I killed was a patient.

24:29.125 --> 24:30.500
He came to me for help.

24:30.583 --> 24:32.083
He was a madman

24:32.167 --> 24:33.667
who was trying to kill you.

24:33.750 --> 24:34.958
What you did was brave,

24:35.042 --> 24:36.375
and it was necessary.

24:36.458 --> 24:37.833
I don't feel brave.

24:39.167 --> 24:40.250
What did he do?

24:46.417 --> 24:47.500
He cut me.

24:48.625 --> 24:50.292
What else?

24:50.375 --> 24:51.792
[♪ ominous music plays]

24:53.792 --> 24:54.792
He choked me.

24:58.500 --> 24:59.542
Show me.

25:01.625 --> 25:02.625
No.

25:09.625 --> 25:10.625
It's okay.

25:39.417 --> 25:43.417
[panting]

25:55.875 --> 25:57.000
[Buck] Heather...

25:57.083 --> 26:00.708
[Heather continues panting]

26:31.042 --> 26:32.208
You feel better?

26:34.292 --> 26:36.125
[exhales]

26:45.625 --> 26:46.750
[BB] So, are you sure that

26:46.833 --> 26:48.458
-your mom's okay with me coming?
-[phone buzzing]

26:48.542 --> 26:50.375
-It's fine.
-All right. Oh, shit.

26:52.208 --> 26:53.208
Ugh.

26:53.292 --> 26:56.042
You know, these Task Force raids
aren't helping, right?

26:56.625 --> 26:58.042
I mean, Fisk has sympathy now,

26:58.125 --> 26:59.792
-but it's not gonna last.
-BB,

26:59.875 --> 27:01.500
vigilantes killed his wife.

27:01.583 --> 27:03.083
Daniel, I was there.

27:03.167 --> 27:05.125
You were there. We saw what happened.

27:05.208 --> 27:06.333
Don't spin to a spinner.

27:09.958 --> 27:11.583
It's not gonna matter much anyway.

27:12.500 --> 27:13.542
What does that mean?

27:23.542 --> 27:24.750
I tell you this,

27:24.833 --> 27:27.458
you gotta promise
that it didn't come from me.

27:27.542 --> 27:29.042
And it cannot be leaked.

27:29.125 --> 27:30.750
Yes, totally. What is it?

27:30.833 --> 27:32.083
No, no, like,

27:32.167 --> 27:33.250
seriously.

27:33.708 --> 27:34.958
Like, you and me. Like...

27:35.542 --> 27:36.708
friends. Like,

27:37.042 --> 27:38.875
-in it together.
-Okay, I got you.

27:39.500 --> 27:40.583
A hundred percent.

27:41.292 --> 27:42.292
You can trust me.

27:45.750 --> 27:47.542
He's not running for re-election.

27:48.583 --> 27:49.750
Wait, what?

27:49.833 --> 27:50.833
That's it.

27:50.917 --> 27:51.917
One and done.

27:52.708 --> 27:54.250
He's out at the end of this term.

27:54.667 --> 27:56.417
Wait, how do you know that?
Did he tell you?

27:56.500 --> 27:57.625
After the funeral.

27:58.292 --> 28:00.083
Guess his heart's not in it.

28:00.167 --> 28:01.917
After Vanessa, you know.

28:04.625 --> 28:05.625
Holy shit.

28:06.042 --> 28:08.167
Yeah. Holy fuckin' shit.

28:09.792 --> 28:10.917
Come on.

28:14.875 --> 28:16.000
-You okay?
-Yeah.

28:16.083 --> 28:17.250
Yeah, I'm okay.

28:18.042 --> 28:19.208
Fucking bitch.

28:19.292 --> 28:21.125
-You sure it was her?
-Yes. I'm sure.

28:21.208 --> 28:22.500
I'm fucking sure.

28:22.583 --> 28:24.125
Hey. Saunders.

28:24.542 --> 28:26.500
-Saunders, right? Yeah.
-Yeah. Yes, sir.

28:27.083 --> 28:28.083
Been looking for you.

28:29.250 --> 28:30.292
I...

28:30.542 --> 28:31.583
heard you lost yours.

28:33.917 --> 28:36.083
[chuckles] Thanks.

28:40.708 --> 28:42.083
Hey, move over, come on.

28:42.708 --> 28:43.708
I'll roll with you.

28:44.292 --> 28:45.500
-Yeah?
-Yeah, yeah.

28:46.917 --> 28:47.917
All right.

28:59.875 --> 29:01.208
Get up.

29:02.625 --> 29:05.833
-[grunting]
-[chains rattling]

29:13.292 --> 29:14.667
Hello, Karen.

29:15.250 --> 29:16.958
Hello, Benjamin.

29:18.125 --> 29:19.333
[grunts]

29:20.417 --> 29:21.500
Your staples...

29:22.542 --> 29:23.542
they hurt?

29:24.958 --> 29:27.833
-[chuckles softly]
-Good.

29:29.250 --> 29:30.625
Are you gonna shoot me?

29:31.833 --> 29:32.833
Probably.

29:32.917 --> 29:33.917
Go ahead.

29:34.375 --> 29:35.958
Vanessa opened the window,

29:36.292 --> 29:37.625
and I went through it.

29:38.958 --> 29:41.042
Your friend Foggy paid the price.

29:41.125 --> 29:42.833
Foggy for my freedom.

29:44.167 --> 29:45.375
Me for Foggy.

29:47.125 --> 29:48.542
It's just an equation.

29:58.458 --> 29:59.583
You know what?

30:00.792 --> 30:02.042
You're right.

30:04.833 --> 30:06.542
[gun clicks]

30:09.792 --> 30:10.875
Thank you.

30:20.292 --> 30:21.708
-[Karen groans]
-[gun clatters]

30:23.667 --> 30:25.208
I can't let you do it, Karen.

30:27.583 --> 30:30.125
[yells] What the hell is wrong with you?

30:30.375 --> 30:32.000
You keep choosing the wrong people!

30:32.083 --> 30:34.750
Fisk! This thing
over the people who love you!

30:35.875 --> 30:38.458
-What?
-Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

30:38.542 --> 30:40.417
-How can you say that?
-Because it's true.

30:40.500 --> 30:42.375
Because you let them live and people die!

30:42.458 --> 30:43.458
Karen...

30:44.833 --> 30:47.125
-Karen...
-Please, just let me do this.

30:50.042 --> 30:51.208
Let me carry this

30:52.167 --> 30:53.250
for you.

30:54.667 --> 30:56.542
All you have to do is walk out that door.

30:56.625 --> 30:57.833
What happened to you?

31:05.250 --> 31:07.375
You know, Christofi never made it
to witness protection.

31:08.250 --> 31:10.083
My source never started broadcasting,

31:10.167 --> 31:13.292
which, knowing Fisk,
probably means that they're both dead.

31:15.833 --> 31:17.458
You wanna know what happened to me?

31:19.750 --> 31:21.167
I grew up.

31:23.667 --> 31:27.083
[footsteps retreating]

31:28.208 --> 31:30.333
[crowd clamoring angrily]

31:35.500 --> 31:36.667
Hey! Off the fence!

31:36.750 --> 31:37.792
Back it up!

31:41.125 --> 31:42.625
Move! Back up!

31:43.917 --> 31:45.458
Check the other entry. Move.

31:48.333 --> 31:49.500
-Hey.
-How you doing?

31:49.958 --> 31:51.667
-I'm all right. Yeah, yeah.
-Yeah? You good?

31:52.208 --> 31:53.417
-I'm all right.
-All right.

31:54.583 --> 31:56.250
Get back! Hey! Off the fence!

31:56.333 --> 31:57.333
Get back!

31:57.417 --> 31:59.000
[clamoring continues]

32:10.208 --> 32:11.750
This, we call,

32:12.292 --> 32:13.625
"The Vital Spectrum."

32:13.708 --> 32:16.333
-Jesus Christ.
-ROY-G-BIV,

32:16.625 --> 32:18.208
right here. So it's red--

32:18.292 --> 32:22.083
Red, orange, yellow,
green, blue, indigo, violet,

32:22.167 --> 32:24.083
-blah, blah...
-Don't listen to him,

32:24.167 --> 32:25.667
-he's nothing but a hater.
-[chuckles]

32:27.292 --> 32:28.375
Who wants more wine?

32:31.333 --> 32:33.083
-Sorry.
-Are you kidding?

32:33.583 --> 32:35.083
Love. Love.

32:37.208 --> 32:38.250
Where's the bathroom?

32:39.583 --> 32:41.542
I'll show you. Come here. Yeah.

32:41.625 --> 32:42.625
Come on.

32:43.958 --> 32:45.375
It's just up there to the left.

32:45.458 --> 32:46.625
-Okay, thank you.
-Yeah.

33:08.875 --> 33:11.625
[breathing anxiously]

33:20.125 --> 33:23.125
I tell the girls, my Vital Spectrum team,

33:23.208 --> 33:25.750
every day, I tell them my son

33:25.833 --> 33:27.458
is gonna change the city.

33:53.958 --> 33:56.167
That Mayor Fisk, he knows talent.

33:56.958 --> 33:57.958
Thanks, Ma.

34:01.875 --> 34:02.917
Your father

34:03.208 --> 34:04.833
would be so proud of you.

34:23.833 --> 34:28.292
-[Gloria] ♪ Happy birthday to you ♪
-[BB] ♪ ...to you ♪

34:28.375 --> 34:33.125
-♪ Happy birthday to you ♪
-♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

34:33.625 --> 34:38.875
-♪ Happy birthday, dear Daniel ♪
-♪ Happy birthday, dear Daniel ♪

34:38.958 --> 34:44.625
[echoing, muffled]
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

34:46.375 --> 34:48.458
[♪ unsettling music playing]

34:56.792 --> 34:58.292
[crowd chanting] Resist! Rebel!

34:58.375 --> 35:00.083
Resist! Rebel!

35:00.167 --> 35:01.750
Resist! Rebel!

35:01.833 --> 35:03.500
Resist! Rebel!

35:03.583 --> 35:05.333
Resist! Rebel!

35:05.417 --> 35:06.958
Resist! Rebel!

35:07.042 --> 35:08.458
Resist! Rebel!

35:08.542 --> 35:09.917
Fuck it, man!

35:10.000 --> 35:11.625
-Come on! Come on!
-Come on!

35:11.708 --> 35:13.458
[crowd] Resist! Rebel!

35:13.542 --> 35:15.167
Resist! Rebel!

35:15.250 --> 35:17.042
Resist! Rebel!

35:20.583 --> 35:21.583
Ma'am.

35:21.667 --> 35:23.167
There's someone here to see you.

35:23.250 --> 35:25.250
It's after midnight. Who's here?

35:25.333 --> 35:27.875
My deepest apologies, ma'am.
It was out of my hands.

35:34.083 --> 35:36.417
-[glass clinking]
-[Mr. Charles] Hi, Marge.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.667
I told you to never come here again.

35:38.750 --> 35:39.792
I missed you, too.

35:39.875 --> 35:41.958
Say, I don't think that's how
the food chain works.

35:42.042 --> 35:45.417
And I don't think the little fish
tells the big fish how to swim.

35:45.500 --> 35:47.375
-I'm the Governor of New York.
-[Mr. Charles] Yeah.

35:47.458 --> 35:49.458
Is this the 20-year Michter's I gave you?

35:49.542 --> 35:52.083
'Cause it is fucking delish.

35:54.458 --> 35:56.625
[footsteps thudding]

36:00.833 --> 36:01.833
All right.

36:02.250 --> 36:03.250
What do you want?

36:03.333 --> 36:04.542
That's the best part.

36:05.583 --> 36:07.417
Not a single goddamn thing.

36:08.083 --> 36:10.958
I am here to solve your City Hall problem.

36:19.833 --> 36:22.542
She, uh, likes it on for the cat.

36:22.625 --> 36:25.292
Hmm. Is Gloria not coming back down?

36:25.375 --> 36:28.292
No, she's got a schedule.

36:28.833 --> 36:31.750
Chardonnay, melatonin, and then she's out.

36:31.833 --> 36:33.083
Wow. Life goals.

36:33.167 --> 36:34.958
-Yeah, really.
-[chuckles softly]

36:35.042 --> 36:36.792
Um...

36:38.417 --> 36:39.875
[Daniel] Dude, what?

36:40.125 --> 36:41.208
No way.

36:41.292 --> 36:43.167
-You didn't have to do that.
-Why not?

36:43.500 --> 36:46.125
-You afraid to see my true colors shine?
-No.

36:48.417 --> 36:49.417
Thank you

36:49.500 --> 36:50.875
for inviting me into your home.

36:50.958 --> 36:53.750
-Hmm.
-No, I really loved it. And...

36:54.917 --> 36:57.042
Well, your mom is a fucking legend.

37:00.917 --> 37:02.792
Happy birthday, Daniel Blake.

37:14.042 --> 37:16.000
[sighs] Fuck.

37:16.458 --> 37:18.292
-What?
-Stop. Just-- Just stop.

37:18.375 --> 37:19.375
What?

37:20.083 --> 37:21.083
What--

37:22.625 --> 37:23.625
What is this?

37:24.583 --> 37:25.917
I found it in your pocket.

37:26.000 --> 37:28.500
It's the next City Without Fear
broadcast, isn't it?

37:30.000 --> 37:31.083
What's on it, huh?

37:31.833 --> 37:34.875
Detainees? Daredevil
breaking out people in Red Hook?

37:34.958 --> 37:36.083
Daniel, please.

37:36.167 --> 37:38.375
-Please, just listen to me. I--
-No, no. No, no. You listen.

37:38.458 --> 37:40.875
You fucked me, and you fucked us!

37:41.833 --> 37:44.833
And, BB, the most messed up part
about this whole thing

37:44.917 --> 37:47.250
is I don't even know
if I can protect you anymore.

37:47.333 --> 37:48.417
Protect me from what?

37:49.083 --> 37:51.000
[cell phone vibrates]

37:51.083 --> 37:52.500
Protect you from him.

37:55.750 --> 37:57.917
[reporter on TV] And breaking news tonight
out of Manhattan.

37:58.000 --> 38:00.708
Demonstrations have escalated
outside City Hall.

38:00.792 --> 38:04.125
Manhattan is on lockdown with authorities
warning it's becoming dangerous.

38:04.208 --> 38:06.292
New York One will continue
to follow the story

38:06.375 --> 38:09.458
and bring you up-to-the-minute reporting
as new information emerges.

38:09.750 --> 38:11.167
[crowd chanting] Resist! Rebel!

38:11.250 --> 38:12.750
-Resist! Rebel!
-Fuck!

38:12.833 --> 38:14.417
-Resist! Rebel!
-Come on!

38:14.500 --> 38:16.000
Resist! Rebel!

38:16.083 --> 38:17.625
Resist! Rebel!

38:17.708 --> 38:19.292
Resist! Rebel!

38:19.375 --> 38:21.125
Resist! Rebel!

38:21.208 --> 38:22.625
Resist! Rebel!

38:22.708 --> 38:24.083
Resist! Rebel!

38:24.375 --> 38:25.500
Resist! Rebel!

38:29.667 --> 38:30.750
[Buck] Sir?

38:36.458 --> 38:38.667
I have... news.

38:43.375 --> 38:45.208
The Governor is pulling her support.

38:45.292 --> 38:47.792
A meeting is happening
with the AG's office tomorrow.

38:49.625 --> 38:51.208
[crowd chanting] Resist! Rebel!

38:51.292 --> 38:52.958
Resist! Rebel!

38:53.042 --> 38:54.292
Resist! Rebel!

38:54.375 --> 38:55.792
[man 1] Fuck this!

38:58.083 --> 39:00.417
-[man 2] Hey, what's that?
-[man 3] Yo, what is it?

39:01.292 --> 39:03.167
My name is Soledad Ayala.

39:04.792 --> 39:06.542
[Ariana] Ariana Iacovou.

39:07.292 --> 39:08.542
[David] David Pulaski.

39:09.167 --> 39:10.208
I am a nurse.

39:10.542 --> 39:12.958
I own a restaurant in Astoria.

39:13.042 --> 39:14.083
[Karen] Come on. Gotta go.

39:15.042 --> 39:16.583
[Soledad] I was detained

39:16.667 --> 39:19.042
and thrown into a cage for weeks.

39:19.958 --> 39:20.958
[Berto] Fisk...

39:21.667 --> 39:24.000
he tried to foreclose on my bodega.

39:24.917 --> 39:27.542
[woman 1] They shut down my salon
for code violations.

39:29.042 --> 39:30.292
[woman 2] I couldn't see a lawyer.

39:30.792 --> 39:32.917
[Ariana] I was detained for weeks.

39:33.000 --> 39:34.000
Caged

39:34.333 --> 39:35.833
like an animal.

39:35.917 --> 39:39.292
Beaten under the Safer Streets act.

39:43.417 --> 39:45.167
[Soledad] We were the missing.

39:47.625 --> 39:48.625
[David] The unheard...

39:49.750 --> 39:50.917
[Ariana] And Daredevil...

39:52.667 --> 39:54.208
[Soledad] Daredevil freed us!

39:56.833 --> 39:57.833
[man] Resist.

39:58.625 --> 39:59.625
[Soledad] Rebel.

40:00.333 --> 40:01.333
[man] Resist.

40:01.583 --> 40:03.000
[in Spanish] Rebelar.

40:05.750 --> 40:07.625
[protestor in English] You're done, Fisk!

40:07.708 --> 40:09.708
[crowd clamoring angrily]

40:26.792 --> 40:28.042
I'm not surprised

40:28.417 --> 40:29.708
you're here, Murdock.

40:32.042 --> 40:33.708
I'm sorry for your loss, Wilson.

40:35.250 --> 40:36.458
Is that why you've come?

40:37.083 --> 40:38.667
To offer condolences?

40:46.500 --> 40:48.458
You know how we tell ourselves
this is about the city.

40:48.542 --> 40:49.542
It's about New York.

40:51.333 --> 40:53.167
I'm not so sure that's true anymore.

40:53.792 --> 40:55.083
Is it?

40:56.667 --> 40:58.083
[horn honking]

41:01.875 --> 41:03.208
No.

41:03.792 --> 41:05.125
This fight...

41:06.625 --> 41:07.750
it is poison.

41:09.958 --> 41:11.625
It destroys everything.

41:14.292 --> 41:15.292
The city, the...

41:16.875 --> 41:17.958
The people we love.

41:20.042 --> 41:21.250
[scoffs]

41:21.333 --> 41:22.375
Nobody wins.

41:22.792 --> 41:24.583
We have to end it now.

41:25.500 --> 41:27.042
Because I am not gonna stop.

41:28.625 --> 41:29.625
I don't know how...

41:31.375 --> 41:32.875
and I don't think you do either.

41:34.250 --> 41:36.125
You're not entirely incorrect.

41:37.333 --> 41:38.458
So what would it take...

41:39.500 --> 41:40.625
for you to walk away?

41:40.708 --> 41:42.042
I'd ask the same of you.

41:43.042 --> 41:44.083
You leave New York.

41:45.375 --> 41:46.458
I leave New York.

41:46.833 --> 41:48.958
[crowd clamoring]

42:03.833 --> 42:05.250
There is nothing

42:05.333 --> 42:06.667
to give to me.

42:12.625 --> 42:13.833
Or take away.

42:16.583 --> 42:18.167
Imagine if we'd never met.

42:21.500 --> 42:22.500
Imagine...

42:23.292 --> 42:24.292
Foggy...

42:25.125 --> 42:26.875
-Vanessa...
-No...

42:27.875 --> 42:29.500
-They would still--
-No!

42:29.750 --> 42:30.750
[screams]

42:38.625 --> 42:39.750
[Powell] Understood.

42:40.125 --> 42:41.292
Thank you, Buck.

42:47.375 --> 42:48.542
Weapons-free, kid.

42:49.833 --> 42:51.292
-I know it was you.
-What?

42:51.375 --> 42:54.083
-What?
-I know it was you, you Fredo fuck.

42:54.167 --> 42:56.458
-[gun fires]
-[crowd screaming]

43:00.750 --> 43:02.208
Powell, what the fuck?

43:02.583 --> 43:03.958
Fucking vigilantes.

43:04.625 --> 43:06.042
They killed Saunders!

43:06.125 --> 43:07.750
On line! On line!

43:08.125 --> 43:10.333
Push those motherfuckers back!

43:10.417 --> 43:13.375
-Push them back!
-[crowd yelling indistinctly]

43:15.208 --> 43:18.125
[both grunting]

43:21.583 --> 43:23.000
[groans]

43:27.625 --> 43:28.958
[yelling indistinctly]

43:41.792 --> 43:44.167
[groans]

43:48.042 --> 43:49.542
[yells angrily]

43:52.625 --> 43:54.583
[Daredevil groans]

44:01.250 --> 44:02.708
Is this really what you want?

44:02.792 --> 44:06.042
[panting] It's what we both want.

44:11.333 --> 44:12.333
Come on!

44:12.417 --> 44:13.875
[Daredevil panting]

44:19.875 --> 44:22.125
[both yelling, grunting]

44:37.125 --> 44:39.042
[grunts in pain]

44:39.125 --> 44:40.375
[crowd chanting] Resist! Rebel!

44:40.458 --> 44:41.917
Resist! Rebel!

44:42.000 --> 44:43.375
Resist! Rebel!

44:43.458 --> 44:45.167
Resist! Rebel! Resist!

45:01.042 --> 45:02.083
